; Lots of one commodity whose prices are in different commodities sort
; by the price commodity's symbol ($ < EUR < GBP), not by the price's
; number: {$5.00} comes first although 5 is the largest price.  Lots
; priced in the same commodity sort by price ({1 EUR} before {2 EUR}).
; The journal buys the lots out of that order on purpose.

2024/01/01 Opening
    Equity:Opening     -3 EUR
    Equity:Opening     $-5.00
    Equity:Opening     -0.50 GBP
    Assets:Cash        3 EUR
    Assets:Cash        $5.00
    Assets:Cash        0.50 GBP

2024/01/02 Buy in euros
    Assets:Broker      1 X {2 EUR}
    Assets:Cash        -2 EUR

2024/01/03 Buy in pounds
    Assets:Broker      1 X {0.50 GBP}
    Assets:Cash        -0.50 GBP

2024/01/04 Buy in dollars
    Assets:Broker      1 X {$5.00}
    Assets:Cash        $-5.00

2024/01/05 Buy in euros again
    Assets:Broker      1 X {1 EUR}
    Assets:Cash        -1 EUR

test bal Assets:Broker --lots
         1 X {$5.00}
         1 X {1 EUR}
         1 X {2 EUR}
      1 X {0.50 GBP}  Assets:Broker
end test
